Content-Disposition: form-data; name="explanation"

Choose θ, A, B, and C using the proved rational-parameter lemma. The strict gap inequality leaves positive slack; the source helper chooses a positive η below one small enough to preserve that inequality after replacing A by A(1−η). These witnesses form the published Parameters record.
